--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
erf_cody.cpp — additional provenance

erf_cody.cpp is not original Jäckel code. Its own header states:

    "Original Fortran code taken from http://www.netlib.org/specfun/erf,
     compiled with f2c, and adapted by hand."

The underlying algorithms are W. J. Cody's rational Chebyshev approximations for
erf / erfc / erfcx (W. J. Cody, "Rational Chebyshev Approximation for the Error
Function", Math. Comp. 23 (1969), pp. 631-638), distributed via netlib SPECFUN,
which is in the public domain and freely redistributable. The f2c-translated file
is redistributed here under the same "preserve this notice" terms as the rest of
the Let's-Be-Rational distribution; its warranty-disclaimer header is preserved.
